{"id":"parlant","lemma":"parlant","pos":"adj","rank":1336,"glosses":["speaking, capable of speech","telling, eloquent"],"ipa":"/paʁ.lɑ̃/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/5/5f/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Pamputt-parlant.wav/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Pamputt-parlant.wav.mp3","forms":{"feminine":"parlante","masculinePlural":"parlants","femininePlural":"parlantes"},"formAudio":{"parlante":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/52/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-J%C3%A9r%C3%A9my-G%C3%BCnther-Heinz_J%C3%A4hnick-parlante.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"J'aimerais trouver un médecin parlant français.","en":"I'd like to find a French-speaking doctor.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to love","l":"aimer"},{"g":"to find"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"physician"},null,{"g":"French"}]},{"text":"Pouvez-vous me présenter à un avocat parlant français ?","en":"Can you introduce me to a lawyer who speaks French?","words":[{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"pouvoir"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"me"},{"g":"to present"},{"g":"to / at"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"lawyer, attorney"},null,{"g":"French"}]},{"text":"Strictement parlant, tu as tort.","en":"Strictly speaking, you're wrong.","words":[{"g":"strictly"},null,{"g":"you"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"fault"}]},{"text":"Y a-t-il quelqu'un parlant français ici ?","en":"Is there someone here who speaks French?","words":[{"g":"there"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"he / it"},null,{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"French"},{"g":"here"}]},{"text":"Tom est la seule personne au bureau parlant français.","en":"Tom is the only person in the office who can speak French.","words":[null,{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"alone","l":"seul"},{"g":"no one, nobody"},{"g":"to the"},{"g":"office"},null,{"g":"French"}]}]}